  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. For 20 second[s], you have a 40% chance to block and an extra 4...9...10% for each additional enchantment (max 80%). All nearby foes are struck for 10...34...40 earth damage each time a Dervish enchantment is removed from you.",
