    },
    "pvp": {
      "en": "Flash Enchantment Spell. For 1...6...7 second[s], you have a 30...54...60% chance to block incoming attacks. When you cast this enchantment, all nearby foes are struck for 10...34...40 earth damage.",
      "zhTW": "持續 1～7 秒，你有 30～60% 機率格檔攻擊。施展此加持時，對附近敵人造成 10～40 土系傷害。"
    }
  },
